      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "CLEO'S STAR (5) has a strong record this track and trip with seven wins and two placings from 14 starts. Recorded a 0.7 lengths win (29.89) in a Mix 3/4 last time at this track. Looks a leading chance on best. EVENTUATE (1) has been beaten for early speed lately, last time finishing fourth (30.09) in a Mix 3/4 at this track. Solid record at the distance winning five races. Has a strong record out of this box with two wins and a minor placing from five starts. Will give the top chances plenty to think about. SCOTT GNARLY (8) drew an outside box and was game in defeat when only 1.5 lengths from the winner Electrify in second(29.98) at this track. Ran one of the fastest times on the program last start despite finishing in the minors. Expecting another good run. ASSASSINATOR (3) was in the money last start despite a big quote and is likely to feature again.",
